示词，每组为一个段落，提示词用于flux文生图，要求：\n1、以分段符为结束标志，不要输出除了分段符以外的其它分隔符，\n2、要有不同的景别，真实摄影风格，细节丰富，\n3、要加一些图片质量提示词，如超清，8k等，\n4、英文输出，只输出提示词，也不要输出其它多余内容，\n5、必须输出5组不同景别、不同场景的提示词，\n6、输出的段落之间不能有空行。\n\n参考示例如下：A breathtakingly beautiful woman, rendered in hyperrealistic detail, is captured in a dramatic close-up, riding atop a colossal demonic dragon. Her flawless face, with skin that has a lifelike texture, wears an expression of serene defiance and otherworldly grace. Her piercing, dark eyes gaze resolutely forward, reflecting the tumultuous sky. Her long, jet-black hair, with individual strands catching the chaotic light, is swept back by the furious wind, held only by a single, luminous pearl pin. She wears a magnificent Hanfu, its layers of pure, moon-white silk embroidered with subtle silver threads. The wide, elegant sleeves and flowing robes billow and whip dramatically around her, their ethereal fabric a stark, beautiful contrast to the raw power beneath her. Her left hand rests gently yet firmly on the dragon's massive, obsidian-scaled neck, a gesture of effortless command. The scales are like jagged volcanic rock, each shimmering with a faint, malevolent crimson glow. Behind them, the sky is a chaotic canvas of swirling storm clouds, illuminated by brilliant flashes of lightning. The entire scene is an epic masterpiece, a breathtaking fusion of ethereal purity and untamed, primal power."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 136, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [205], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314], "pos": [2111.78173828125, 429.4775695800781], "widgets_values": ["a85723a04ee0d9ed394afe6cc0f3050cd223b2b08454fbe78b7840ed8769